          <a href="#mcp" class="sidebar-link">What is Folio MCP?</a>
          <a href="#mcp-flag" class="sidebar-link">Zero-Setup Connection (--mcp)</a>
          <a href="#mcp-clients" class="sidebar-link">Client Configurations</a>
          <a href="#mcp-tools" class="sidebar-link">MCP Tools Reference</a>
          <a href="#mcp-presets" class="sidebar-link">Custom Presets</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-group">
          <p class="sidebar-title">Development</p>
          <a href="#development" class="sidebar-link">Cloning & Local Dev</a>
          <a href="#running-tests" class="sidebar-link">Running Tests & Audits</a>
